{{#> page title="Educational courses - Instincts Training"}}
  <section class="bg-neutral-600 text-neutral-50 relative">
    <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:flex">
      <div class="space-y-8 px-4 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-16 lg:py-32 md:w-1/2">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold">
            Our educational courses
          </h1>
          <div class="text-lg lg:text-2xl">
            We offer a range of educational courses covering a variety of topics, all of which can be tailored to better
            suit your needs
          </div>
        </div>
        <img class="md:hidden" src="/img/IMG_1967.jpg">
      </div>
      <img class="hidden md:block md:w-1/2 md:object-cover xl:absolute xl:right-0 xl:h-full" src="/img/IMG_1967.jpg">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-stone-100 text-neutral-600">
    <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-16 lg:py-32 grid md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-x-8 gap-y-8
                items-center">
      <div class="space-y-6 md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6">
        <p class="lg:text-lg">
          Our educational courses tackle the subject of anti-social behaviour, whether that be violence, harassment,
          misogyny, or consent. Our courses are designed to address why we should not be heading down these paths to
          criminality.
        </p>
        <p class="lg:text-lg">
          We very often tell people what they should not be doing but fail to expand on the why. By describing
          consequences, whether it be psychological or criminal we explore how the path to criminality never ends well
          no matter what side or angle you look at it from.
        </p>
      </div>
      <img class="object-cover max-h-60 sm:max-h-96 md:max-h-full w-full md:col-span-4 md:row-start-1"
        src="/img/IMG_2173.jpg">
      <p class="lg:text-lg md:col-span-7 md:col-start-1">
        We use lived experience and true-life testimony to bring these messages home. Our Training Director has worked
        in educational establishments up and down the UK including secondary schools, colleges, PRU’s \ Alternative
        Provision Establishments and His Majesties Young Offenders Institutes (HMYOI) along with several Violence
        Reduction Units and Police forces to gain first-hand experience in tackling the problems we face in society.
      </p>
      <img class="object-cover max-h-60 sm:max-h-96 md:max-h-full w-full md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9"
        src="/img/IMG_1699.jpg">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-600">
    <div class="max-w-screen-lg mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-16 lg:py-32 space-y-8">
      <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold">
          Courses
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-neutral-400">
        {{#> accordion-item index=1 title="Misogyny"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Learn to recognise, challenge and change harmful attitudes and behaviours.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            We explore what misogyny looks like, where it can come from, how it affects others and how individuals can
            challenge it.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Misogyny thrives in silence. We create space for honest conversations and positive change.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=2 title="Sexual harassment"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            See it. Challenge it. Stop it.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Explore what sexual harassment looks like, how it can affect people and what individuals
            can do when they witness or experience it.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The course also introduces effective bystander strategies and encourages respectful
            behaviours and safer environments.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=3 title="Online safety"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Protect your clicks!
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Help young people understand the risks of the online world, including harmful content,
            online abuse, manipulation, exploitation and unsafe choices.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Participants develop practical tools to protect themselves, recognise warning signs and
            know where to turn for help.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=4 title="Self defence & personal safety"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The best weapon is knowledge.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Build awareness, confidence and practical personal safety skills.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The course focuses on recognising risk, understanding boundaries, using awareness and
            communication, and knowing what options are available if a situation becomes unsafe.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=5 title="One punch can kill"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            One moment. One punch. Lives changed forever.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            A powerful look at the real consequences of violence and impulsive decisions.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The course explores escalation, peer pressure, consequences, decision-making and why
            walking away can sometimes be the strongest choice.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=6 title="Values & behaviour"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Our values influence how we behave, respond and treat other people.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            This course helps participants explore their own values, attitudes and behaviours and
            understand how these can affect relationships and the wider environment around them.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The aim is to build self-awareness, respect, accountability and positive behaviour.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=7 title="Knife awareness"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Understand the risks, realities and consequences of knife-related incidents.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Rather than focusing on fear, the course looks at awareness, decision-making, risk,
            consequences, early intervention and safer choices.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The emphasis is on prevention and helping people understand what they can do to reduce
            risk.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=8 title="Understanding violence"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Why does violence happen?
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            This course explores why situations can escalate, what warning signs to look for and how
            emotions, behaviour, environment and decision-making can influence what happens next.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Participants develop greater awareness and confidence to make safer choices before a
            situation becomes dangerous.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=9 title="Instinctive first aid"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            When something happens, every second can matter.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            This practical course gives participants basic first aid knowledge and the confidence to
            respond appropriately in unexpected situations.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Participants learn how to stay calm, assess what is happening and provide appropriate
            help while waiting for further support.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-stone-100 text-neutral-600">
    <div class="max-w-screen-md mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-16 lg:py-32 space-y-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold">Ready to learn?</h2>
      <p class="lg:text-lg">
        All the courses above can be tailored to a bespoke package to suit individual needs. We will sit down with you
        if required to discuss in detail how we can help and make sure we tick all your boxes for your specific
        requirements. We can assess risk assessments and make sure your policy is relevant and within the law for your
        establishment in accordance with the Health and Safety at Work Act and Employment Law. Our mission is to keep
        things relevant and real.
      </p>
      {{#> link-button style="dark" href="/contact"}}Contact{{/link-button}}
    </div>
  </section>
{{/page}}
